# Configuration for Legacy Flutter App
# 
# In Flutter, environment variables can be passed during build/run using the --dart-define flag.
# 
# API_URL - Base URL of the backend API
# 
# Usage:
#   flutter run --dart-define=API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api/
#   flutter build apk --dart-define=API_URL=https://your-domain.com/api/
